# Vexlum Scoring (`image-scoring-backend`)

> Stub — the authoritative agent rules live in `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`,
> `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`, and `docs/CANONICAL_SOURCES.md`. This file exists
> for Cursor IDE compatibility and provides a brief orientation only.

## What this is

AI image quality scoring, tagging, clustering, and gallery API backend.
Python 3.10+, FastAPI on port 7860, PostgreSQL + pgvector as primary store.
React SPA at `/ui/`; Gradio operator page at `/app`.

## Where to look first

- `CLAUDE.md` — project overview, backlog contract, key modules.
- `AGENTS.md` — MCP server registration, search+dispatch, tool inventory.
- `docs/CANONICAL_SOURCES.md` — authoritative file map (API, schema, phases).
- `docs/technical/PIPELINE_TERMINOLOGY.md` — canonical phase codes.
- `docs/technical/API_CONTRACT.md` and `docs/reference/api/openapi.yaml` — REST contract.
- `docs/technical/MCP_SEARCH_DISPATCH.md` — compact MCP workflow.
- `docs/technical/DB_SCHEMA.md` — schema reference.
- `.agent/PROJECT_GUIDE.md`, `.agent/SAFETY.md`, `.agent/COMMANDS.md`.
- `.cursor/rules/` — short, focused rules (each `.mdc` documents its scope).
- `.agent/AGENT_INFRA_INVENTORY.md` — every agent-facing file with its status.

## Core technologies (current)

- Python 3.10+ in WSL (`~/.venvs/tf`) for app/scripts; `~/.venvs/image-scoring-tests` for WSL pytest.
- FastAPI via `launch.py` / `webui.py`; Gradio operator page at `/app`.
- REST API: `modules/api/` package (domain routers under `routers/`).
- PostgreSQL + pgvector via `modules/db_postgres.py`; routed by `modules/db/` facade.
- Models: MUSIQ (TF), LIQE / TOPIQ / Q-Align (PyTorch via pyiqa), BLIP/CLIP for captioning.
- Embeddings: 1280-d MobileNetV2 default space (see `docs/EMBEDDINGS.md`).
- Pipeline phases: `indexing` → `metadata` → `scoring` → `culling` → `keywords`.
- MCP: **`is-be-mcp`** (stdio search+dispatch), optional **`is-be-live`** (SSE when WebUI runs).

## Related projects

- **image-scoring-gallery** — Electron desktop UI (sibling repo).
- **image-scoring-ui** — shared design tokens (`@synthet/image-scoring-design`).

## Diagnostics

- `python scripts/doctor.py` — config + DB + pgvector (`--no-gpu` to skip CUDA).
- `python scripts/export_debug_bundle.py` — redacted support zip; review before sharing.
- See `docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md` and `docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md`.

## Tests

```bash
# Fast subset, no hardware deps (WSL + ~/.venvs/tf)
python -m pytest -m "not gpu and not db and not ml" --ignore=tests/test_probe.py
```

WSL-marked tests: `~/.venvs/image-scoring-tests` via `scripts/wsl/run_wsl_tests.sh` or `Run-WSLTests.ps1`.

Markers: `gpu`, `db`, `ml`, `wsl`, `network`, `sample_data`, `postgres`, `inference_e2e`.
See `docs/TESTING.md` and AGENTS.md (Pytest E2E vocabulary).

## Hard rules

- **PostgreSQL is primary.** Firebird is decommissioned; tests live under
  `tests/archive_firebird/` and are not collected.
- **Do not invent endpoints, columns, phase names, or config keys.** Cite
  `docs/CANONICAL_SOURCES.md` if unsure.
- **Never modify `.git/config`** — see CLAUDE.md for the rationale.
- **Do not commit** `secrets.json`, debug bundles, thumbnails, model caches,
  or anything under `.agent/scratch/`.
- **Backlog contract** — every task starts from the GitHub Project board
  (https://github.com/users/synthet/projects/1). See `.cursor/skills/backlog-queue/SKILL.md`.

## Cross-repo

- Sibling: `image-scoring-gallery` (Electron + React).
- API/schema/phase changes flow backend → gallery. See
  `.agent/workflows/cross_repo_contract_change.md`.

## Git configuration — do not modify

Never modify `.git/config` — do not set `extensions.worktreeConfig`, change
`core.repositoryformatversion`, or add any git extensions. Third-party tools
(Gemini Code Assist / Antigravity) use embedded git libraries that fail on
non-standard extensions, breaking workspace resolution. If a worktree is
needed, use a temporary one and clean it up immediately.
